('asc-economics-ba', 'specialization', 'Economics', 'College of Arts and Sciences', 'Economics, BA (current advising sheet)', null, null, 'Both degrees are STEM-designated (CIP 45.0603). The BS is the more quantitative path. At least 30 credit hours at the 2000 level or above; C- or better in each major course and a 2.00 GPA across the major; no Pass/Non-Pass. At least half the major''s hours must be Ohio State courses (not AP or transfer credit). A second major needs at least 18 hours that don''t overlap with the first. Up to two GE Theme courses (one Citizenship, one other Theme) may count on the major; GE Foundation courses may not.', 'https://economics.osu.edu/majors-and-minors', 429, '{}'::text[], 'asc-ba', null, null, null, '{}'::text[], '{}'::jsonb),
