('asc-english-wrl-ba', 'specialization', 'English: Writing, Rhetoric and Literacy', 'College of Arts and Sciences', 'English: Writing, Rhetoric and Literacy, BA (current advising sheet)', null, null, 'About 36 credit hours in the major. 12 unique courses (36 hours), 27 hours at 3000+, including one Embedded Literacy: Technology course; C- in each course (C in the methods course). Up to 6 hours can also count as GE Themes. Students who started before Autumn 2023 follow the older English major sheet (https://english.osu.edu/undergraduate/english-major). At least 30 credit hours at the 2000 level or above; C- or better in each major course and a 2.00 GPA across the major; no Pass/Non-Pass. At least half the major''s hours must be Ohio State courses (not AP or transfer credit). A second major needs at least 18 hours that don''t overlap with the first. Up to two GE Theme courses (one Citizenship, one other Theme) may count on the major; GE Foundation courses may not.', 'https://english.osu.edu/english-major-au-23/writing-rhetoric-and-literacy-wrl-specialization', 449, '{}'::text[], 'asc-ba', null, null, null, '{}'::text[], '{}'::jsonb),
('asc-english-preed-ba', 'specialization', 'English: Pre-Education', 'College of Arts and Sciences', 'English: Pre-Education, BA (current advising sheet)', null, null, '36-38 12 unique courses (36 hours), 27 hours at 3000+, including one Embedded Literacy: Technology course; C- in each course (C in the methods course). Up to 6 hours can also count as GE Themes. Students who started before Autumn 2023 follow the older English major sheet (https://english.osu.edu/undergraduate/english-major). Leads to an M.Ed. or post-baccalaureate licensure program in Integrated Language Arts (grades 7-12). At least 30 credit hours at the 2000 level or above; C- or better in each major course and a 2.00 GPA across the major; no Pass/Non-Pass. At least half the major''s hours must be Ohio State courses (not AP or transfer credit). A second major needs at least 18 hours that don''t overlap with the first. Up to two GE Theme courses (one Citizenship, one other Theme) may count on the major; GE Foundation courses may not.', 'https://english.osu.edu/english-major-au-23/pre-education-specialization', 450, '{}'::text[], 'asc-ba', null, null, null, '{}'::text[], '{}'::jsonb),
