('asc-zoology-bs', 'specialization', 'Zoology', 'College of Arts and Sciences', 'Zoology, BS (current advising sheet)', null, null, 'About 30 credit hours in the major. Pre-med and pre-vet students need a full year of organic chemistry (CHEM 2510-2520) and likely the labs (2540, 2550). At least 30 credit hours at the 2000 level or above; C- or better in each major course and a 2.00 GPA across the major; no Pass/Non-Pass. At least half the major''s hours must be Ohio State courses (not AP or transfer credit). A second major needs at least 18 hours that don''t overlap with the first. Up to two GE Theme courses (one Citizenship, one other Theme) may count on the major; GE Foundation courses may not.', 'https://eeob.osu.edu/sites/default/files/2026-10/Zoology%20Major%202027.pdf', 475, '{}'::text[], 'asc-bs', null, null, null, '{}'::text[], '{}'::jsonb),
