('cis-ba-related', 'asc-cis-ba', 6, 'Related field (at least 18 hours)', 'manual', null, null, null, null, '{}'::text[], 'At least 18 hours numbered 2000 or above in one related field: a pre-approved field (Art and Design; Communication; Economics, Accounting, and Business; Game Design and Animation; Linguistics) or one you design with the CIS BA faculty advisor''s approval. 12 hours form the related-field core; at least 6 more are related-field electives.', null),
